@startuml Vas-Vis Ingestion

title Vas-Vis - Recording Ingestion
autonumber

participant "main.cpp" as Main
database "data.csv" as Csv
participant "CsvGyroLoader" as Loader
participant "CharlesArm" as Arm
participant "DataPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "FrameTrack" as Track

Main -> Loader: LoadGyroCsv("data.csv")
Loader -> Csv: Read rows
Csv --> Loader: Raw gyro fields
Loader -> Loader: Validate rows
Loader -> Loader: Skip TEMP rows
Loader -> Loader: Sort and normalize timestamps
Loader --> Main: GyroRecording

Main -> Arm: Construct with recording
Arm -> Pipeline: Apply sample pipeline
Pipeline --> Arm: Processed samples
Arm -> Arm: Map sensors and integrate gyro values
Arm -> Arm: Build joint positions
Arm -> Track: Add and sort frames
Track --> Arm: Precomputed FrameTrack
Arm --> Main: Ready for playback

@enduml
